# Owner's Illustrator workspace (the PATH to the assets, not the app —
# the exported bundle copies in shared/assets/ ARE committed). The FOLDER
# DOC is the one exception: the navigation chain from README.md must hold
# on a fresh clone (desktop/tests/test_doc_links.py), so the .md travels,
# the 160 MB of .ai masters do not.
