# Claude — the session's own scratch stays local, but the ENFORCEMENT
# must travel: `settings.json` carries the PostToolUse/Stop hooks that
# run desktop/tests/run_guards.py (rules/CODE.md -> Enforcement), and the
# verify skill is this project's build/launch recipe. `.claude/` stays at
# the TRUE repo root (THE THREE-FOLDER MIGRATION, 2026-08-12) — it did not
# move into desktop/. `settings.local.json` is personal (per-machine
# permission grants) and stays out.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json


